msgstr "What you pick up goes to your flipper; if you’re already holding something, to your shell. Everything has weight: carry a lot and you tire sooner."

#. Key:	TipSearch
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Tortunabo/Private/Lobby/TN_TutorialTexts.h(97)
#: Source/Tortunabo/Private/Lobby/TN_TutorialTexts.h(97)
